OL,3,GNEWSARiled politicians slam 'offensive'
OL,4,AHIGNFY post
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoliticians have hit out at a TV show's
OL,7,F"offensive" social media post which
OL,8,Fmocked a town over the government's
OL,9,F"tourist tax" plans.
OL,11,FThe BBC's Have I Got News For You
OL,12,F(HIGNFY) X account made reference to
OL,13,FMiddlesbrough after regional mayors
OL,14,Fwere given powers to introduce an
OL,15,Fovernight levy.
OL,17,F"Because who hasn't been to
OL,18,FMiddlesborough [sic] and thought 'I
OL,19,Fshould have paid more money to be
OL,20,Fhere,'" it read, also misspelling its
OL,21,Fname.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
