OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1789489657
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARiled politicians slam 'offensive'
OL,4,AHIGNFY post
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative Tees Valley Mayor Ben
OL,7,FHouchen described it as a "typical
OL,8,Fluvvie comment" while Labour MP for
OL,9,FStockton North Chris McDonald said it
OL,10,Fwas "offensive to Teesside". Hat Trick
OL,11,FProductions, which is independent of
OL,12,Fthe BBC, has been approached for
OL,13,Fcomment.
